{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12875","headline":"送故人赴江陵寻庾牧 · 韩翃","name":"送故人赴江陵寻庾牧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"主人持节拜荆州，走马应从一路游。\n斑竹冈连山雨暗，枇杷门向楚天秋。\n佳期笑把斋中酒，远意闲登城上楼。\n文体此时看又别，吾知小庾甚风流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12875.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12875","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}